 * Delaunay-reduced, which is the case for the cell-based path but not for an
 * arbitrary imported representation.  Reducing the primitive basis here makes
 * the classification invariant under a legal change of basis, origin, or
 * operation ordering.
 *
 * On success, prim_lat and prim_symmetry are overwritten in place and 1 is
 * returned.  On failure nothing is modified and 0 is returned, leaving the
 * caller with the original (unreduced) quantities. */
